finchart_gui_chart_api.py creates funtions as intermediary for finchart and tkinter program.
for example demo_gui_chart.py uses finchart_gui_chart_api.py for implementing interaction level funtions like drawing,copying,pasting,selecting,modifying,deleting shapes.
